The '''Green Zone'''  is an island in the [[Second Sea]].

==Appearance==
The Green Zone is wrapped by a shallow, rocky beach, and is connected to [[Kingdom of Rose]] by the [[Bridge]]. The island is mostly covered in grass, with a small number of paths and rocks. Large amounts of vegetation can also be seen, including huge flowers and vines, some of which extend great distances into the sky.

