==Trivia==
* Some of the leaf wings at the Green Zone have a hitbox to stand on, while some do not, which can be quite confusing.
** Because of this, [[Flight]] abilities are recommended for the purpose of reaching the top of the vine.
* The Green Zone has one of the highest points of altitude in the [[Second Sea]].
* This island has a small area where the {{Flower|Red}} Flower can spawn.
* The Green Zone is not a place that the player can directly teleport to using [[Portal]], so the player can instead teleport to Dock 3, which is connected to the island.

